# No Canvas (absolute for project work)

Do **not** create, edit, open, or use a Cursor Canvas (`.canvas.tsx`) for any
project development work — reviews, status reports, dossiers, plans, comparisons,
methodology analyses, architecture notes, security notes, or tabular data.

Put deliverables in the **chat reply** as markdown. Delete leftover project
`canvases/*.canvas.tsx` files when found during a task.

No exception for agent convenience. Only when the user **explicitly** asks for a
canvas in the same message.

Also: `~/.cursor/rules/no-canvas-for-text.mdc`.
